OL,3,ATwitch and Amazon face legal action
OL,4,Aover using livestreams to train AI
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmazon is facing a lawsuit over its
OL,7,Fmove to train its AI models on videos
OL,8,Fpeople broadcast on the popular
OL,9,Fstreaming platform Twitch.
OL,11,FThe move faced backlash from users when
OL,12,Fit was announced in August - with
OL,13,Fpeople having the option to opt-out if
OL,14,Fthey do not want their data used this
OL,15,Fway.
OL,17,FThe class action lawsuit has been
OL,18,Fbrought on behalf of millions of
OL,19,Fstreamers who use Twitch, alleging its
OL,20,Fparent company Amazon used their videos
OL,21,Fto train AI without their permission or
OL,22,Fproper compensation.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/18
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
