OL,3,ACharity? Acting? The Cotswolds? What
OL,4,Awill Harry and Meghan's UK life look
OL,5,Alike?
OL,6,
OL,7,FWithin the next few days, the Duke and
OL,8,FDuchess of Sussex and their two
OL,9,Fchildren will have departed California
OL,10,Fand become residents of the UK.
OL,12,FSince news broke of the move, there has
OL,13,Fbeen some confusion as to what British
OL,14,Flife for Harry and Meghan will look
OL,15,Flike - but a picture is emerging of the
OL,16,Ffamily's priorities.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/18
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,163,160,200,105,0,100
PN,11913
SC,0013
CT,25,T
PS,c008
