OL,5,G2100 The Blues Show with Shaun Keaveny
OL,6,     FShaun Keaveny sits in, with the
OL,7,     Fweekly round-up of the blues you
OL,8,     Fneed to hear!
OL,9,G2200 The Good Groove with Melvin Odoom
OL,10,     FFeelgood tunes to groove and
OL,11,     Fsoothe your soul. Dr Odoom is in
OL,12,     Ffor Dr Beat to prescribe a perfect
OL,13,     Ftune for a listener whose week
OL,14,     Fhasn't got off to the best start!
OL,15,G0000 OJ Borg
OL,16,     FOJ found out that one of his
OL,17,     Ffriends is great at packing vans,
OL,18,     Fso he'd love to know what mundane
OL,19,     Fthing you're really good at. Is it
OL,20,     Fpacking the dishwasher? Or folding
OL,21,     Fthe clothes?
